      beforeBody: `<ul><li>Use Chrome and keep Yandex Music open in a tab.</li><li>Install YM Bridge from the Chrome Web Store.</li><li>Have a Last.fm account ready. The Windows companion is not required for scrobbling.</li></ul>`,
